{"id":"65921","name":"爽口辣萝卜丁","author":"彼岸a","authorId":"1854810","desc":"","cover":"images/65921/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"1斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"萝卜洗干净","img":"images/65921/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"萝卜皮切下，稍厚点，这道凉菜只用到萝卜皮。","img":"images/65921/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将萝卜皮改刀，切成丁","img":"images/65921/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加二勺盐，拌均，腌二十分钟","img":"images/65921/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"姜、蒜洗干净","img":"images/65921/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切成末","img":"images/65921/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"腌好的萝卜丁，把水滗干，加入切好的姜、蒜末","img":"images/65921/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再加入二汤勺辣椒面","img":"images/65921/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀","img":"images/65921/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装到干净的玻璃瓶子里，放入冰箱，过24小时就可以吃了。吃的时候浇上芝麻油。","img":"images/65921/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}